      "help": "Connect Note Clock to Matrix External Clock. Each change plays one column at the selected note value. All columns play, even across a bar line. In 6/8, twelve sixteenth notes fill a bar.\n\nTrigger pulses at the start of the selected number of bars. Connect it to Play or Launch to deliberately restart a pattern or clip there. Connect Tempo to Piano Roll Tempo to follow changes. A clip learns its first connected tempo as its original speed. Launch starts the clip separately.\n\nClock subdivides the lower number of the meter using Steps. Older Clock connections use this outlet. Reset starts the grid over."
